शृङ्गाट, अम्, n. a place where four roads meet;
(अस्), m. the aquatic plant Trapa Bispinosa; the
shrub Ruellia or Barleria Longifolia.

शृङ्गारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, feeling love or amorous pas-
sion; full of love, amorous, enamoured, impassioned;
relating to love; stained with red-lead; (ई), m. an
impassioned lover; an elephant; dress, decoration;
the Areca or betel-nut tree; a ruby (= माणिक्य).

